1493	// ─── Shared constraint solver ─────────────────────────────────────────────
1494	// Extracted from the /generate and /generate-stream endpoints to eliminate
1495	// ~900 lines of duplication. Both endpoints call this function; the streaming
1496	// version passes optional callbacks that emit SSE events at key points.
1497	
